{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123594","id":4565100741,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEBnoxQ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123594","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123594.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123594.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123594","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123594/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123594/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123594/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/f1b3ab82a7234840f8220483a617580be0c725cb","number":123594,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Lock ClassDB writes in extension registration and property defaults.","user":{"login":"exaltedo2","id":173569997,"node_id":"U_kgDOClh3zQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173569997?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2","html_url":"https://github.com/exaltedo2","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/exaltedo2/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThis is a follow-up to PR #123546; I am adding locks to functions that were simply overlooked. This was done to ensure the task is completed thoroughly, as similar errors existed elsewhere.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n`set_property_default_value()` and `unregister_extension_class()` write to `default_values` and `default_values_cached`, yet—as I noted in the previous PR—they lack the necessary locking mechanism. Additionally, while `register_extension_class()` does have a lock, it is the wrong one; it uses `GLOBAL_LOCK_FUNCTION`, which is distinct from the `ClassDB` Locker and fails to function correctly in this context. That code predates the Locker mechanism introduced in #102449, and it was overlooked because #102449 focused solely on converting the `OBJTYPE_*LOCK` macros.\r\n\r\nTests\r\n\r\nSince Godot's test suite lacks a test that exercises extension class registration, I wrote a tiny GDExtension that registers a class and ran 5 unload/load cycles; additionally, the full test suite and doctool are clean.\r\n\r\nNotes\r\n\r\nTested on Windows only.\r\n#122481 stays open; #122481 is a bigger issue.\r\n\r\nAI Disclosure\r\n\r\nI wrote the code and performed the analysis with Claude's help, and I ran `/code-review`. I handled the testing and verification myself and understood the changes.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https:/